        <mxCell id="r13" value="CP-3 forbid for every principal; hidden from tools/list" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C8CDD3;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="472" width="310" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg" value="CP-1 10-permit-reads (5 policies), CP-2 20-permit-ticket-writes, CP-3 30-forbid-mutations, CP-4 40-forbid-unbounded, CP-5 50-support-no-data (3 policies): 11 policies in policy/cedar/. CP-5 forbids data tools &lt;i&gt;unless&lt;/i&gt; the read scope is present, so a missing tag fails closed." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5A6B86;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="512" width="840" height="50" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
